  m_Name: LoginPuzzleTidbit
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BoundSpiritRuntime::InformationalTidbitData
  title: 
  body: "As you've seen, you can often find out <u><b> someone's password with personal
    information</u></b> if their password contains information relating to them that
    can be found out. \nThis information can be found out through digging through
    openly available information(OSINT) or by getting the information out of the
    target directly through conversation or other interaction (social engineering).
    It is important to safeguard your information!"
